{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/5a724f11b34fbc287b22d512813a3f9d.avif?t=1771087549\" width=616 height=392 /></span><br>Organize an unique comic con that belongs to you!<br>The story happens in the homeland of Metropolitan. When the whole nation is enduring an economic crisis, you become the one who rises up to be the organizer and going to save the world by doing it.           <br>The ultimate goal is defeating your competitors to become the king of the comic con and saving the Metropolitan!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/3f1d30c6ab8fd7fddbfb1608b295963e.poster.avif?t=1771087549\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/3f1d30c6ab8fd7fddbfb1608b295963e.webm?t=1771087549\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/3f1d30c6ab8fd7fddbfb1608b295963e.mp4?t=1771087549\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/c178fd1f490b8acf14175f10f2ee525e.webp?t=1771087549\" width=616 height=60 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Set up your characteristic comic con</h2>In this game, you could play as different characters to organize your own comic con. You are able to design the booths and NPCs on your own will so as to satisfy customers.  In SLG mode, you will use skill cards to defeat your competitors.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/a635bded9014f29673fa31028d64b045.avif?t=1771087549\" width=616 height=130 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dealing with the random events and discover the hidden Easter Eggs</h2>Fire? Zombie? Alien? Uncountable imaginative random events are offered. Therefore, you could have much more fun than you ever expected.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/9f3c3bb3ccfd8f189b6c3f82c65e69bf.avif?t=1771087549\" width=616 height=130 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfectly support for MOD</h2>You can create and import the booth/character/NPC designed by yourself only by few simple steps. This game is also available on Steam Workshop. Welcome to share your fantastic ideas with other players in workshop!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/extras/47970e9368aa1d087d672cafe0ecdddc.avif?t=1771087549\" width=616 height=130 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"efb57452074defd44e6cbef1bd7343e790e831e0.jpg","localized_name":"Cool Newbie Leader","name":"Cool Newbie Leader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917020/efb57452074defd44e6cbef1bd7343e790e831e0.jpg"},{"icon":"3d477165fa22b9b0fccb337b4493f52f665a9460.jpg","localized_name":"They Are Dozens!","name":"They Are Dozens!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917020/3d477165fa22b9b0fccb337b4493f52f665a9460.jpg"},{"icon":"25b131d86c15524a52d9e4d4babde8905ee4495d.jpg","localized_name":"Level1","name":"Level1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917020/25b131d86c15524a52d9e4d4babde8905ee4495d.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/917020?t=1771087549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/917020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771087549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item